      'Pehle 5-6 ideas aksar wahi hote hain jo sabke dimaag me aate hain, kyunki dimaag sabse aasaan, sabse use hone wale connections pehle deta hai. Jab ye khatam ho jaate hain, tab dimaag door ke connections dhoondhne lagta hai, aur wahin se original ideas aate hain.',
      'Research me ye bhi dikha hai ki group brainstorming me log aksar akele sochne se kam ideas dete hain (ek bolta hai to baaki rukte hain, aur judge hone ka darr rehta hai). Isliye pehle akele likho, phir group me milao.'
