      'Baad ki studies ke reviews me incubation effect asli paya gaya, khaas kar un problems me jinke kai jawab ho sakte hain. Ek wajah ye maani jaati hai ki break se galat raaste par atka hua dhyaan dheela padta hai (fixation tootti hai), aur dimaag doosre connections try kar paata hai.',
      'Dhyaan do: incubation tabhi kaam karta hai jab pehle preparation hui ho. Bina mehnat ke "break" sirf taalna hai. Aur break me phone scroll karna utna kaam nahi karta jitna halka, bina dimaag waala kaam (naha lena, walk, bartan dhona), kyunki scroll dimaag ko nayi information se bhar deta hai.'
