      'Kaam kyun karta hai: hamara dimaag kisi cheez ko uske normal use se jod kar dekhta hai. Psychology me ise <b>functional fixedness</b> kehte hain (Karl Duncker ka famous candle problem: log thumbtack ke dibbe ko candle ka stand nahi soch paate, kyunki wo "dibba" hai). SCAMPER ke sawaal har baar is fixedness ko alag angle se todte hain.',
      'Khaali kaagaz se "kuch naya socho" bahut mushkil hai. "Isme se kya hata sakte hain?" jaisa specific sawaal kaafi aasaan hai. Constraints aur prompts dimaag ko pakadne ke liye handle dete hain.'
