      '<b>Substitute</b>: plastic dabbe ki jagah steel ke dabbe, wapas lene ka system. <b>Combine</b>: tiffin ke saath haftay me ek baar ghar ka achaar. <b>Adapt</b>: Netflix se idea, "is hafte ka menu" WhatsApp par Sunday ko. <b>Eliminate</b>: 4 sabzi ki jagah 2 achhi sabzi, kam daam me. <b>Reverse</b>: customer khud menu vote kare. <b>Put to other use</b>: shaam ko coaching ke bachchon ke liye chhota snack box.',
      'Unhone do cheezein try ki: Sunday menu poll aur coaching snack box. Snack box ne naye customer laaye jo baad me tiffin bhi lene lage. Ye idea kabhi "kuch naya socho" se nahi aata, "Put to other use" ke sawaal ne use nikala.'
