      'Scientific papers par hue bade data studies me dikha ki sabse zyada impact wale papers aksar zyada-tar jaani-pehchaani research par khade hote hain, par unme ek-do ajeeb, kam dikhne wale jod bhi hote hain. Matlab: poora naya nahi, <b>purane + ek unexpected jod</b>.',
      'Is skill ke liye do cheezein chahiye: apne field ki gehri samajh (warna jod bekaar hoga), aur doosre fields se zara-si jaan-pehchaan. Ek T-shape: ek cheez gehri, kai cheezein thodi.'
